meId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 18149311, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790956558523, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "未使用的尺寸不占位；切换形状保留原输入。\n椭圆必须注明全轴尺寸，不能写成半轴。", "originalText": "未使用的尺寸不占位；切换形状保留原输入。\n椭圆必须注明全轴尺寸，不能写成半轴。", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3, "index": "b7O"}, {"id": "978ca32f683e41b6b695fb34da5c9055", "type": "rectangle", "x": 5968.716310043583, "y": 655, "width": 510, "height": 435, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#314454", "backgroundColor": "#13212d", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 2059546545, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790956558523, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b7P"}, {"id": "e321dfa7f30743cebc25344dfdca4aec", "type": "text", "x": 5984.716310043583, "y": 672, "width": 303.76, "height": 31.200000000000003, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#59d5c9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 763273183, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790956558523, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "其余模块采用同一分组方式", "originalText": "其余模块采用同一分组方式", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3, "index": "b7Q"}, {"id": "2b9e25f487dd4042b9a4f1166e7b4d3c", "type": "text", "x": 5996.716310043583, "y": 725, "width": 32.1, "height": 22.1, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#a8bed2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1730351505, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790956558523, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Tx", "originalText": "Tx", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3, "index": "b7R"}, {"id": "30af6e3491e84802a9e8d8d7c956705d", "type": "text", "x": 6093.716310043583, "y": 725, "width": 278.64, "height": 41.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#dae4ed", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1568492543, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790956558523, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "脉冲形状 + 脉宽；H/V 发光角域。\n列内发数 + 发射间隔。", "originalText": "脉冲形状 + 脉宽；H/V 发光角域。\n列内发数 + 发射间隔。", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3, "index": "b7S"}, {"id": "70aa3a06e0a44fbcbe89541ae910a474", "type": "text", "x": 5996.716310043583, "y": 825, "width": 44.68, "height": 22.1, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#a8bed2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1020049265, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790956558523, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "电学", "originalText": "电学", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3, "index": "b7T"}, {"id": "c957efe419294dceb10940b7b6380b94", "type": "text", "x": 6093.716310043583, "y": 825, "width": 301.04, "height": 62.400000000000006, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#dae4ed", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1292989471, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790956558523, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "拓扑：角通道/chip + chip/link。\n容量：lane数 + 线速 + 净效率。\n格式决定字宽 / range记录长度。", "originalText": "拓扑：角通道/chip + chip/link。\n容量：lane数 + 线速 + 净效率。\n格式决定字宽 / range记录长度。", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3, "index": "b7U"}, {"id": "8d55380bf99043298144b85f12b84483", "type": "text", "x": 5996.716310043583, "y": 954, "width": 79.36, "height": 22.1, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#a8bed2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1577492817, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790956558523, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "距离参考", "originalText": "距离参考", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3, "index": "b7V"}, {"id": "6096ada77f524099ba50315e6746100e", "type": "text", "x": 6093.716310043583, "y": 954, "width": 238.48000000000002, "height": 41.6, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#dae4ed", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1680578623, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790956558523, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "扫参：最小距离 + 最大距离。\n采样点数另列；实测模式分开。", "originalText": "扫参：最小距离 + 最大距离。\n采样点数另列；实测模式分开。", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3, "index": "b7W"}, {"id": "9b586357d9be483784035f7de357575f", "type": "rectangle", "x": 5968.716310043583, "y": 1110, "width": 510, "height": 232, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#314454", "backgroundColor": "#13212d", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 2015907633, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790956558523, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "b7X"}, {"id": "07cb7d8700bd4e2aa784e4532e6f3f80", "type": "text", "x": 5984.716310043583, "y": 1127, "width": 132.39999999999998, "height": 31.200000000000003, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#59d5c9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 950810719, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790956558523, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "交互与层级", "originalText": "交互与层级", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3, "index": "b7Y"}, {"id": "4f30d6596d7f4094b7d389d7298d27cd", "type": "text", "x": 5996.716310043583, "y": 1174, "width": 382.13, "height": 110.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9caebe", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 563691793, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790956558523, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "• 模块折叠；保留成对值摘要。\n• 分组轻边框、统一间距，不再套一层折叠。\n• 输入在上，单位 / 派生值 / 帮助在组内。\n• 窄屏可竖排，但仍保留同一个分组框。\n• 悬停参数显示定义，点选联动对应示意图。", "originalText": "• 模块折叠；保留成对值摘要。\n• 分组轻边框、统一间距，不再套一层折叠。\n• 输入在上，单位 / 派生值 / 帮助在组内。\n• 窄屏可竖排，但仍保留同一个分组框。\n• 悬停参数显示定义，点选联动对应示意图。", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3, "index": "b7Z"}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}